MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Segmented: APG arrow-key roving focus (RTL-aware), optional tab/panel id wiring; MatchDetail/TeamPage panels are real tabpanels; the Browse filter is now aria-pressed toggles instead of an unfulfilled role=tab promise
- expected-points table: dimmed uncovered rows darken the fill instead of opacity-55 (was ~2.4:1, now AA-passing)
- empty states: emoji shorthand centrally swapped for drawn SVG icons (new ClockIcon); unknown emoji stripped
- inline ad: token colors, card radius, solid border — no more dashed/broken chrome on the money screen
- back button falls back to /matches on the session's first entry instead of leaving the mini app
- haptics toggle is enforced at the lib/telegram choke point (was stored but never read)
- danger toasts are dismissible; favorites shelf shows a shape-matched skeleton; view-only note on timeline comment threads
- deleted unused duplicate pages/Browse.tsx and stale back-navigation roots; new FA/EN strings flagged for native review

